== 1.7 Chapter 1 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [A body carrying a charge of 3.2 × 10⁻¹⁹ C has gained],
  [3 electrons],
  [1 electron],
  [2 electrons],
  [20 electrons]
)

#mcq(2, [The charge on a body is 5.0 µC. In coulombs this is],
  [5.0 × 10⁶ C],
  [5.0 × 10³ C],
  [5.0 × 10⁻³ C],
  [5.0 × 10⁻⁶ C]
)

#mcq(3, [Two charges are brought from a separation of 0.20 m to 0.10 m. The force between them],
  [halves],
  [is unchanged],
  [becomes four times as large],
  [doubles]
)

#mcq(4, [Two positive charges of 2.0 µC and 8.0 µC are 0.30 m apart in air. The force between them is],
  [16 N, repulsive],
  [1.6 N, attractive],
  [1.6 N, repulsive],
  [0.16 N, repulsive]
)

#mcq(5, [A charge of +4.0 µC and a charge of −6.0 µC are 0.30 m apart. The force between them is],
  [0.24 N, attractive],
  [2.4 N, repulsive],
  [2.4 N, attractive],
  [24 N, attractive]
)

#mcq(6, [A body is charged negatively by friction. This is because it],
